=   entry .Error   raised when XML or HTML does not hold a MathML tree
-     detail
+     detail

-         Error `↯/s.129.1`: _the MathML could not be parsed because reason_. Raised by `Math.aggregable`,
-         `Math.loadable`, `Math.loadableData`, `Mathml.Parser` and `Mathml.Reader` when the
-         root element is not `<math>` or an element has a label which is not a MathML
-         element. Well-formedness of the XML itself is xylophone's `Xml.Error` and
-         `Parse.Error`, raised before this one.
+         Error `↯/s.129.1`: _the MathML could not be parsed because reason_. Lo lanzan
+         `Math.aggregable`, `Math.loadable`, `Math.loadableData`, `Mathml.Parser` y
+         `Mathml.Reader` cuando el elemento raíz no es `<math>` o un elemento tiene una etiqueta
+         que no es la de un elemento MathML. La buena formación del propio XML corresponde a
+         `Xml.Error` y `Parse.Error` de xylophone, que se lanzan antes que este.

=         `Parse.Error`, raised before this one.
=
-         ```scala
+         ```scala

=         `Parse.Error`, raised before this one.
=
=         ```scala
-         import soundness.*
+         import soundness.*

=         import soundness.*
-         import xmlSchemas.freeformXmlSchema
+         import xmlSchemas.freeformXmlSchema

-         safely(t"<svg><rect/></svg>".read[Math])   // Unset: the root was <svg>
+         safely(t"<svg><rect/></svg>".read[Math])   // Unset: the root was <svg>

=         safely(t"<svg><rect/></svg>".read[Math])   // Unset: the root was <svg>
-         ```
+         ```

-         Under `strategies.throwUnsafely` the same read throws, and the error's `#reason` is
-         `Mathml.Error.Reason.NotMathml(t"svg")`.
-     entry .Reason   why the tree is not MathML: `NotMathml(label)` or `UnknownElement(label)`
-         `NotMathml(label)` (reason 1, _the root element was `<label>` instead of `<math>`_):
-         the document's root, or the HTML page, had no `<math>` element; the label is
-         `<missing>` when a fragment or a page held none at all. `UnknownElement(label)`
-         (reason 2, _the element `<label>` is not a known MathML element_): an element inside
-         `<math>` whose tag `Mathml.Parser.decodeNode` does not recognise.
-     entry .communicable   renders each reason as its message
-     entry #reason   which fault was found
-   entry .Parser   decodes a xylophone `Xml` tree into `Math` and `Mathml` nodes
+         Con `strategies.throwUnsafely`, la misma lectura lanza una excepción, y el `#reason` del
+         error es `Mathml.Error.Reason.NotMathml(t"svg")`.
+     entry .Reason   por qué el árbol no es MathML: `NotMathml(label)` o `UnknownElement(label)`
+         `NotMathml(label)` (motivo 1, _the root element was `<label>` instead of `<math>`_): la
+         raíz del documento, o la página HTML, no tenía ningún elemento `<math>`; la etiqueta es
+         `<missing>` cuando un fragmento o una página no contenía ninguno.
+         `UnknownElement(label)` (motivo 2, _the element `<label>` is not a known MathML
+         element_): un elemento dentro de `<math>` cuya etiqueta no reconoce
+         `Mathml.Parser.decodeNode`.
+     entry .communicable   representa cada motivo como su mensaje
+     entry #reason   qué fallo se encontró
+   entry .Parser   decodifica un árbol `Xml` de xylophone en nodos `Math` y `Mathml`

=   entry .Parser   decodes a xylophone `Xml` tree into `Math` and `Mathml` nodes
-     detail
